 * A SegmentShape (capsule) B is completely covered by SegmentShape A if:
 * 1. The width of B is less than or equal to the width of A (wB <= wA).
 * 2. Every point on the centerline segment of B ([B.start, B.end]) has a distance
 *    to the centerline segment of A ([A.start, A.end]) that is less than or
